  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "step-1",
      "number": 1,
      "heading": "Roast the squash",
      "blocks": [
        "Preheat the oven to 220°C / 200°C fan / gas mark 7. Trim the squash, halve it lengthways and scoop out the seeds. Peel if you prefer, then cut into 2 cm chunks.",
        "Toss the squash with oil, mixed herbs, salt and pepper on a large tray. Spread in a single layer, using two trays if needed.",
        "Roast on the top shelf until golden and cooked through, 25–30 minutes."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Roast squash",
          "seconds": [
            1500,
            1800
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "sausage-traybake-1",
        "path": "media/sausage-traybake-1.webp",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 296,
        "alt": "Card photograph for step 1",
        "credit": "HelloFresh recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "number": 2,
      "heading": "Add the pear",
      "blocks": [
        "Meanwhile halve the unpeeled pear lengthways, remove its core and cut into about eight wedges.",
        "After the squash has roasted for about five minutes, add the pear with a little more oil and toss together. Roast for the remaining 20–25 minutes, turning halfway through."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Roast pear and squash",
          "seconds": [
            1200,
            1500
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "sausage-traybake-2",
