        "width": 620,
        "height": 295,
        "alt": "Card photograph for step 3",
        "credit": "HelloFresh recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "number": 4,
      "heading": "Add the kale",
      "blocks": [
        "While everything cooks, stir the fig jam and balsamic vinegar together in a small bowl. Season with salt and pepper.",
        "In a medium bowl, coat the kale with {{dressing-oil}} olive oil and season. When the vegetables are ready, lay the kale on top and roast for 6–7 minutes until crisp."
      ],
